BUNDLED WORK
============

LRI Drop links the `light` crate from the lightmotiv workspace, which is a fork
of lri-rs by gennyble:

    https://github.com/gennyble/lri-rs

All `.lri` parsing in this application — the container format and the Protobuf
metadata inside it — comes from that work. Released binaries of LRI Drop
therefore contain code under the following terms:

